<title>UK: Christies 96 pretax up 57 pct to 34 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Christies 96 pretax up 57 pct to 34 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.77		  vs 8.03</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.75		   vs 2.8</p>
<p> Pretax		     33.9		   vs 21.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   226.95		 vs 191.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Auctioneers and art specialists Christie's International plc said the profit growth was supported by auction sales up by 9.0 percent and improved commission yields.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
